{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"grp-pipeline","type":"group","x":-120,"y":-800,"width":1320,"height":2380,"color":"1","label":"月結流程 Monthly Pipeline (2026-07) — ✅ 已完成 Completed"},
		{"id":"n-title","type":"text","text":"# Global Purchase Report RPA\n## Monthly PowerShell Pipeline — 2026-07 ✅ Completed 2026-08-26","x":-40,"y":-760,"width":500,"height":80},
		{"id":"n-step1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Build-GlobalPurchaseReport.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 合併7個實體資料＋更新匯率表，產出當月新報表\nMerges all 7 entities' data + updates the exchange rate block, produces this month's new Report file\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 7個實體皆用實際日期欄位驗證過 all 7 entities verified via real date-column checks","x":-20,"y":-600,"width":850,"height":150},
		{"id":"n-step1-5","type":"text","text":"### 1.5 Get-PenExchangeRate.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 補 STANDARD EXCHANGE RATE.xls 缺少的 PEN 匯率（MAZ 用），寫入 Exchange Rate 分頁 M欄\nFills the PEN rate gap (needed for MAZ), writes it into the Exchange Rate tab column M\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — M欄=2.2973，13筆 MAZ PEN交易受益 13 MAZ PEN rows covered","x":-20,"y":-420,"width":850,"height":150},
		{"id":"n-step2","type":"text","text":"### 2. 手動填 AA2:AB2 並計算 Manual AA2:AB2 fill + calculate\n**Purpose 用途:** 為新增列補上 Max/Min PO Price 公式，是後續步驟能否正確執行的前提\nFills Max/Min PO Price formulas for new rows — a precondition for the next step\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done","x":-20,"y":-240,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-step3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Complete-FormulaColumns.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 依相依順序逐欄填入並凍結 AC~AI 公式，並產出「新供應商」複核表\nFills/freezes columns AC–AI in dependency order, builds the New Vendors review sheet\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — AC:AJ 已確認填值 confirmed populated","x":-20,"y":-70,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-tvs","type":"text","text":"### Update-TVSTranslations.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 修正 TVS 翻譯欄與 Commodity Code\nFixes TVS's translation column and Commodity Code\n**本月狀態:** ✅ N/A — Copilot 已手動完成 completed manually via Excel Copilot","x":880,"y":-240,"width":280,"height":480},
		{"id":"n-step9-slack","type":"text","text":"### 9. New-MonthlySlackPost.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 發到 Slack `global_purchase_report` 私人頻道，附加互動式HTML報表\nPosts to the Slack `global_purchase_report` private channel, with the interactive HTML report attached\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 2026-08-27 真的發布到頻道（含HTML附件與網頁版介紹文案）\nActually posted live to the channel (with HTML attachment and web-version intro copy)\n⚠️ 沒有草稿機制，執行後立刻真實發布，所有頻道成員馬上看得到\nNo draft concept — posts live immediately, visible to all channel members right away\n實測發現並修正兩個真實bug：(1) 私人頻道檔案上傳必須用頻道ID非頻道名稱；(2) 附件路徑原寫死無日期檔名，`-Publish`後會被改名成有日期版本，已改為依 `-ReportMonth` 自動算出正確檔名\nFound and fixed two real bugs: (1) private-channel file uploads need a channel ID not a name; (2) the attachment path was hardcoded to an undated filename that gets renamed after `-Publish` - now computed from `-ReportMonth`","x":-20,"y":1200,"width":980,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-step8-gmail","type":"text","text":"### 8. New-MonthlyEmailDraft.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 建立 Gmail 草稿通知（比照舊RPA的16人收件人清單與主旨/內文格式，3位To+13位Cc）\nCreates a Gmail draft notice (matches the old RPA's 16-person recipient list and subject/body format, 3 To + 13 Cc)\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 2026-08-27 真的寄出給16位真實收件人（使用者親自檢查後寄送）\nActually sent to all 16 real recipients (reviewed and sent by the user)\n只建草稿，絕不自動寄出；沿用 Weekly Exchange Rate RPA 專案已授權的 Gmail OAuth；新增 `-IncludeHtmlIntro` 開關（一次性網頁版介紹文案）\nOnly ever creates a draft, never auto-sends; reuses Weekly Exchange Rate RPA's Gmail OAuth; added `-IncludeHtmlIntro` switch (one-time web-version intro copy)","x":-20,"y":960,"width":850,"height":200},
		{"id":"n-step-html","type":"text","text":"### （選用 VBA - Optional）Generate-PurchaseReportHtml.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 轉成單一自包含互動式 HTML（圖表、篩選、CSV 匯出），方便手機/平板瀏覽\nConverts the finalized report into a single self-contained interactive HTML for mobile/tablet viewing\n**Status 狀態:** ⏳ 未執行 Not run — SOP 刻意不自動排入流程，需等 AA/AB 定稿後才手動跑（現已定稿，可執行）\nSOP deliberately keeps this manual, only after AA/AB are finalized (now finalized — can be run)","x":-20,"y":740,"width":850,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-step4","type":"text","text":"### 4. New-ReportAuditSummary.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 產出稽核摘要：報表最後列號、各實體當月列數、當月總列數\nProduces an audit summary: last row, each entity's row count, total rows this month\n**Status 狀態:** ❓ 未確認是否執行 Unconfirmed whether run this month — 唯讀不影響其他步驟 read-only, doesn't block anything else","x":-20,"y":100,"width":850,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-step5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Publish-OutsideReport.ps1\n**Purpose 用途:** 將定稿報表發布/對外輸出這個月的最終版本\nPublishes/outputs the finalized version of this month's report externally\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done — 交付檔已產出 deliverable produced：\nFIN_MHK+STC+MZQ+MIL+RACO_PUR_REPORT-(1-7)2026_20260826_RV0.xlsx\n本次新增：同步擴充到 OUTSIDETEMP_VBA_PRACTICE.xlsm + 啟動前 EXCEL.EXE 安全檢查 + 手動計算模式（修正實測46分鐘以上的效能問題）\nNew this run: extended to also sync OUTSIDETEMP_VBA_PRACTICE.xlsm + pre-run EXCEL.EXE check + manual calculation mode (fixed a 46+ min runtime)","x":-20,"y":270,"width":850,"height":220},
		{"id":"n-vba-practice-issue","type":"text","text":"### ✅ 已解決 Resolved: OUTSIDETEMP_VBA_PRACTICE.xlsm\n跟 OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx 同一種已損壞/缺失的 data 命名範圍問題（曾影響18個樞紐分析表）——2026-08-27 人工在名稱管理員新增（非編輯）工作表層級名稱 data，指向 =Table1[#All]。已用三種方式交叉驗證：25個樞紐分析表全部重新整理成功、COUNTA(data)回傳合理列數、欄位名稱正確無誤。\nSame broken/missing `data` named-range issue OUTSIDETEMP.xlsx had (used to affect 18 PivotTables) — fixed 2026-08-27 by manually creating (not editing) a workbook-scoped `data` name pointing at `=Table1[#All]`. Cross-verified three ways: all 25 PivotTables refresh successfully, COUNTA(data) returns a sensible row count, and field names are all correct.","x":-20,"y":510,"width":850,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-step10-prodfami","type":"text","text":"### 10. ProdFamiDesc（產品家族）+ HTML 報表擴充\n**Purpose 用途:** 來源 Excel 新增第37欄 ProdFamiDesc；HTML 報表新增點擊篩選、欄寬拖曳調整、Product Family 篩選、SKU/Part 家族圓餅圖、拆分 KPI 卡片\nSource Excel gained a 37th column ProdFamiDesc; HTML report gained click-to-drilldown, drag-to-resize columns, Product Family filters, SKU/Part family pie charts, split KPI cards\n**Status 狀態:** ✅ 已完成 Done 2026-09-02 — 新增一次性工具 Copy-ProdFamiDescToSource.ps1（核對列對齊後複製回正式來源檔）；SOP 升到 v1.16；已 commit + push GitHub\nAdded one-off tool Copy-ProdFamiDescToSource.ps1 (row-verified copy into the official source file); SOP bumped to v1.16; committed + pushed to GitHub\n⚠️ ProdFamiDesc 目前不含 TVS 與 MAZ 資料（來源自動化尚未涵蓋，已另行申請）\nProdFamiDesc currently excludes TVS and MAZ (source automation doesn't cover them yet, requested separately)","x":-20,"y":1560,"width":980,"height":260,"color":"6"}
	],
